      <activity id="55a77a3e-599c-5b5a-afd3-767f786c9823" activityNameId="ec793f12-71b7-5879-a4aa-8f5c94a50665" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Industrial residue wood, hardwood, including bark, u=70%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Industrial residue wood, hardwood, including bark, u=70%, at plant
The volume refers to the wood not including the bark. The multi-output process "sawing / debarking, hardwood, at plant" delivers the two coproducts "sawn timber, hardwood, raw, plant-debarked, u=70%, at plant" and "industrial residue wood, hardwood, including bark, u=70%, at plant". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process.;
UUID: 14635e0c-0fe8-3c09-98d3-0b1459c8e5fa
Includes transports from forest, sawing, and debarking at sawmill.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Technology mix used in Germany 1986
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography and Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that Germany is representative for central Europe is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_14635e0c-0fe8-3c09-98d3-0b1459c8e5fa.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
